 Nexus  Overview  Wi-Fi  Ethernet  VPN  Hotspot  Settings                                  ● Online
╭ Connections ───────╭ All keys ──────────────────────────────────────────────╮────────────────────╮
│ ▸ ● Wi-Fi          │  j / k, Down / Up     Move in the list                 │░                   │
│     Home-5G        │  g / G                Jump to top / bottom             │█░░                 │
│   ○ Ethernet       │  h / l, Left / Right  Previous / next tab              │░                   │
│     Not connected  │  Tab / Shift-Tab      Next / previous tab              │░                   │
│   ○ VPN            │  1 - 6                Jump to a tab                    │░                   │
│     Not connected  │  Enter                Open the selected card's tab     │█░░                 │
│   ○ Hotspot        │  d                    Details sheet (small windows)    │░                   │
│     Not started    │  Wi-Fi: Enter         Join the selected Network        │                    │
│                    │  Wi-Fi: r             Rescan                           │ooks healthy.       │
│                    │  Wi-Fi: x             Disconnect                       │.1                  │
│                    │  Wi-Fi: f             Forget (asks first)              │────────────────────╯
│                    │  Wi-Fi: a             Toggle autoconnect               │────────────────────╮
│                    │  Wi-Fi: e             Edit the Profile's settings      │⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ │
│                    │  Wi-Fi: s             Share as a QR code (asks first)  │⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀ │
│                    │  Wi-Fi: u             Undo the toast's action          │⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀ │
│                    │  o                    Open a Portal's login page       │⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀⣀ │
│                    │  Esc                  Back out; never quits            │────────────────────╯
│                    │  ?                    Show or hide this help           │────────────────────╮
│                    │  q, Ctrl-C            Quit                             │                    │
│                    │                                                        │                    │
│                    │ Login page won't show? A browser with secure DNS (DNS  │                    │
│                    │ over HTTPS) hides the Portal by skipping the network's │                    │
│                    │ resolver. Turn it off until you have signed in, or     │                    │
│                    │ press o: Nexus opens a plain http:// page.             │                    │
╰────────────────────╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯────────────────────╯
